      "fields": {
        "summary": "Build idempotent payment retry handler",
        "description": "Build an idempotent retry handler with circuit breaker pattern for payment processing. Must prevent duplicate charges during network failures and gateway timeouts. Uses svc-payment-api service account.\n\nAcceptance Criteria:\n- Idempotency key based on transaction ID + merchant ID\n- Circuit breaker opens after 5 consecutive failures\n- Half-open state probes every 30 seconds\n- Retry with exponential backoff (max 3 retries)\n\nGitLab MR: !302\nChange Request: CHG0090102\nTest Case: TC-PAY-003",
        "issuetype": {"name": "Story", "subtask": false},
